<title>UK: Barclays confirms Morgan Stanley talks.</title>
<headline>Barclays confirms Morgan Stanley talks.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Barclays Plc on Monday confirmed it was in talks with U.S. investment bank Morgan Stanley Group Inc regarding possible cooperation in the field of global custody.</p>
</text>
